113 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 93 0 R
/E (The primary goals of the Personalized Career Path Recommendation System are to analyze student interests, skills, and academic backgrounds, providing tailored career path recommendations. Moreover, the system aims to suggest necessary skills and learning resources, ensuring a user-friendly experience. Integration of AI/ML technology will enhance the accuracy and adaptability of recommendations, ultimately empowering students in their career choices.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
