>>
endobj
115 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 94 0 R
/E (Current career guidance methods often rely on static sessions with advisors or generic online questionnaires. These approaches lack personalization and fail to incorporate students' unique academic backgrounds, skills, and interests. Consequently, students are left with inadequate information, leading to uninformed decisions that can result in dissatisfaction and wasted resources. There is a pressing need for a more dynamic and intelligent guidance system.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
116 0 obj
<<
