/S /H1
/P 95 0 R
/T (Proposed System)
/E (Proposed System)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
117 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Our full-stack web application leverages AI technology to analyze students' interests, skills, and academic backgrounds. By providing personalized career path recommendations, the system enhances decision-making and promotes informed choices. With an interactive dashboard and continuous updates based on user feedback, the application ensures that students receive tailored guidance, making their career exploration journey more efficient and engaging.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
