>>
endobj
119 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (The methodology for our system involves a systematic approach to data collection and processing. It begins with students inputting their interests, skills, and academic records. This data undergoes preprocessing, followed by AI/ML model processing that matches students to suitable career paths. The system then generates personalized recommendations and learning resources, continuously improving through a user feedback loop for enhanced accuracy and effectiveness.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
